# Navigation

Highland look. Conventional, short, clean – like a serious agribusiness, not a style studio.

Desktop: circular logo + **Avocado · Poultry · Cattle · Goats · About us** + language toggle. The toggle is a rectangular ENG/SW control, not a globe icon and not the word “Kiswahili”. Each item is a small dropdown (2 links max). No search bar. No studio chips.

Mobile: logo + Menu. Same five items inside.

Labels must exist in EN and SW (`src/i18n/messages.js`). Word choice should sound natural in Kiswahili.

Hero is a fade slideshow. Each slide has its own headline and CTA. Primary buttons use fill-up hover. Quiet CTAs use cinematic underline.

Section entrance: identity.io fade-rise (`opacity` + `translateY`, once, stagger). No bounce, no AOS/GSAP.
